#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:3
#: c5db6f452e25490a8212cfe08a6af32d
msgid "分层堆叠（Layer Stack）"
msgstr "Layer Stack"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:5
#: 1d2bde4b33db414596c9795658da3d1b
msgid "**分类：** 结构"
msgstr "**Category:** Structure"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:7
#: 12174f4d05c34afa8273267dc28c392f
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:9
#: 6d23726938bb43c5afc8bb5ee23ec191
msgid "把一个已经沿全局笛卡尔 z 方向定向的完整 slab 复制成双层或多层结构。每个输入固定输出 一个结构，所有副本具有相同元素、逐原子数组和可选表面形变。"
msgstr ""
"Replicate a complete slab already oriented along global Cartesian z into a bilayer or"
" multilayer structure. Each input produces exactly one output, and every copy has the"
" same elements, per-atom arrays, and optional surface deformation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:12
#: 6d3d0b28282f41c1a35f37b2f7835ee3
msgid "它与扩胞不同：`Super Cell` 沿晶格 a/b/c 整数重复晶胞；本卡沿全局笛卡尔 z 以指定 表面间隙堆叠完整 slab。它不负责切表面、拼接两种材料或结构弛豫。"
msgstr ""
"This differs from cell expansion: `Super Cell` repeats a cell an integer number of "
"times along lattice a/b/c, whereas this card stacks complete slabs along global "
"Cartesian z with a specified surface gap. It does not cut surfaces, join two "
"materials, or relax structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:15
#: aef099644b7a424f9d87572947ed03da
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:17
#: 089bea6881a0493d81b66f02b29d8f36
msgid "可选形变先对选中的输入原子施加"
msgstr "The optional deformation is first applied to selected input atoms:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:19
#: efdacafec84444dab2da0f8b11523ff5
msgid ""
"\n"
"z_i'=z_i+f(x_i,y_i,z_i).\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:23
#: acd3bd2470f349ac9c0b00c304bdd50d
msgid "设形变后 slab 的 z 向厚度为"
msgstr "Let the z thickness of the deformed slab be"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:25
#: 5070d4bcd81e4035b85aa566b0f9e17d
msgid ""
"\n"
"t=\\max_i z_i'-\\min_i z_i',\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:29
#: 21a744440fa84672beff2ab6d4d4c2c3
msgid "新卡片默认让用户填写真实表面间隙 $g$，相邻完整副本的平移量自动计算为"
msgstr ""
"By default, the card accepts the actual surface gap $g$ and calculates the "
"translation between adjacent complete copies as"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:31
#: 3f29fc477d0c4ad38bec0e26607c7bbe
msgid ""
"\n"
"d=t+g,\\qquad \\Delta z_k=k d,\\quad k=0,1,\\ldots,L-1.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:35
#: cd64c7e819ea4a4b9ee2a7ffd1a33cd9
msgid "因此厚度为 `3 Å` 的 MoS₂ slab、间隙为 `3.35 Å` 时，副本平移量是 `6.35 Å`， 而不是会造成 `0.35 Å` 近接的 `3.35 Å`。"
msgstr ""
"For a MoS₂ slab with a thickness of `3 Å` and a gap of `3.35 Å`, the copy translation"
" is therefore `6.35 Å`, not `3.35 Å`, which would create an unphysical `0.35 Å` "
"separation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:38
#: 2357a91011c0460ca434897cbb32f246
msgid "每个输出的原子数和结构数为"
msgstr "The atom count per output and the structure count are"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:40
#: a88e2a93d3be40918c65dc13eae4ffdb
msgid ""
"\n"
"N_{\\mathrm{atoms,out}}=L N_{\\mathrm{atoms,in}},\n"
"\\qquad N_{\\mathrm{out}}=N_{\\mathrm{in}}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:45
#: 321cca0e70b44cdc80c0b0f6c58e0ce2
msgid "开启晶胞扩展时，只增加第三条晶格矢量的笛卡尔 z 分量："
msgstr ""
"When cell extension is enabled, only the Cartesian z component of the third lattice "
"vector is increased:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:47
#: c976ce0693d641b28283428a37e8a253
msgid ""
"\n"
"c_z'=c_z+(L-1)d+v,\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:51
#: e98a0b337a00492384070e512350d0a4
msgid "其中 $v$ 是顶部附加真空。a、b 以及 c 的 x/y 分量不变，原子不会自动居中。"
msgstr ""
"Here $v$ is additional vacuum above the stack. Lattice vectors a and b, and the x/y "
"components of c, remain unchanged. Atoms are not centered automatically."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:53
#: 4a8a3381274a4a4895c9f721e236b66b
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:55
#: 30347c165f294087b2a08fcd17785a2a
msgid "输入一个 3 原子的 MoS₂ 单层，设置 `2` 层、表面间隙 `3.35 Å`："
msgstr "For a three-atom MoS₂ monolayer, set `2` layers and a surface gap of `3.35 Å`:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:57
#: ea587d1d5e77435cb09f810b004ca090
msgid "预览厚度 `3 Å`、副本平移量 `6.35 Å`；"
msgstr "The preview shows a `3 Å` thickness and a `6.35 Å` copy translation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:58
#: b7c4dd8b2d224a91951d5a3b7a38468c
msgid "输出一个 6 原子结构；"
msgstr "The output is one six-atom structure."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:59
#: c2280e0efdb94d0c9561c69516a1142f
msgid "原有 `spin`、`initial_magmoms`、`group` 等逐原子数组按层复制；"
msgstr ""
"Existing per-atom arrays such as `spin`, `initial_magmoms`, and `group` are "
"replicated with each layer."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:60
#: d70b13d2ea23417ba8696cf8052fde37
msgid "原有 `info` 保留，`Config_type` 追加 `LayerStack(...)`。"
msgstr "Existing `info` is retained and `LayerStack(...)` is appended to `Config_type`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:62
#: fad4f79500b44a87bc7f58a3de6d20ef
msgid "运行前应在预览中核对厚度、间隙、平移量、输出原子数和最终晶胞。"
msgstr ""
"Before running, verify the thickness, gap, translation, output atom count, and final "
"cell in the preview."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:64
#: 12174f4d05c34afa8273267dc28c392f
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:66
#: 5fde660d1ab445e885f99d06f2011064
msgid "堆叠参数"
msgstr "Stacking parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:68
#: da4a777bfb564139a88d3285b59dd6e9
msgid "总层数（layers）"
msgstr "layers"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:70
#: 20b3bd84dbeb44ca81f5083e75dbb52a
msgid "`int`，默认 `2`，范围 `1–999`，包含原始 slab。`1` 只保留一份结构，可用于单独施加 表面形变。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `2`, range `1–999`, including the original slab. `1` retains a single "
"copy and can be used to apply only the surface deformation."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:73
#: 8fd93c8938204fdeab7d460384fed28a
msgid "间距定义（distance_mode）"
msgstr "Spacing Definition (distance_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:75
#: 66cc62341aba4fd4a607ee5569e6941c
msgid "`str`，默认 `surface_gap`："
msgstr "`str`, default `surface_gap`:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md
#: 6e0d04fc475546c4b38bff9a21ad5161
msgid "值"
msgstr "Value"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md
#: a563d866d59343afaef62490e5ace142
msgid "含义"
msgstr "Meaning"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md
#: 3a99d5b47b0f40e7aa9c83b436692865
msgid "`surface_gap`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md
#: b8633a705fd84dc387c6ab6193c32432
msgid "`distance` 是形变后相邻 slab 表面之间的空隙，推荐新任务使用"
msgstr ""
"`distance` is the gap between the surfaces of adjacent deformed slabs; recommended "
"for new workflows"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md
#: 46bb878d888f456b82478de187bb88be
msgid "`translation`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md
#: af5eb652fbda43ce883d148948f20155
msgid "`distance` 是原点到原点平移量，仅用于兼容旧配置"
msgstr ""
"`distance` is the origin-to-origin translation; retained only for legacy "
"configurations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:82
#: 242fb4c368534345bd833ef24918df9a
msgid "旧平移量小于形变后 slab 厚度时会得到负间隙，程序将拒绝运行。"
msgstr ""
"A legacy translation smaller than the deformed slab thickness gives a negative gap "
"and is rejected."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:84
#: 9b635bda23ab411081e2d1ea1febdc42
msgid "间距数值（distance）"
msgstr "Spacing Value (distance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:86
#: d171395049c64334849f67c976b52b8b
msgid "`float`，默认 `3.35 Å`。其含义由 `distance_mode` 决定。表面间隙必须非负；多层旧式 平移量必须为正。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `3.35 Å`. Its meaning is determined by `distance_mode`. A surface "
"gap must be nonnegative, and a legacy translation for multiple layers must be "
"positive."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:89
#: b0eaf7a57ab74a778323c8bb7c653b82
msgid "每个输出的原子预算（max_output_atoms）"
msgstr "Atom Budget per Output (max_output_atoms)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:91
#: a139de58354a49409fc03f17f93ddba4
msgid "`int`，默认 `100000`。若 `输入原子数 × 总层数` 超过预算，程序会在复制前拒绝，避免 意外耗尽内存。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100000`. If `input atom count × total layers` exceeds the budget, the"
" operation is rejected before replication to prevent accidental memory exhaustion."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:94
#: fd1bcccdd7394ab885187f7b3ed505b9
msgid "最终晶胞"
msgstr "Final Cell"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:96
#: af48be396c6c443598c74e3c442a39b6
msgid "沿笛卡尔 z 扩展晶胞（extend_cell_z）"
msgstr "extend_cell_z"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:98
#: 7349520907ad4f28987d56b19eaae621
msgid "`bool`，默认开启。要求晶格矢量 c 的笛卡尔 z 分量为正，并验证最终晶胞有限、非奇异且 不反转手性。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, enabled by default. Requires a positive Cartesian z component of lattice "
"vector c and verifies that the final cell is finite, nonsingular, and retains its "
"handedness."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:101
#: a2c8d94cfc72450096cf8260f17de73a
msgid "额外顶部真空（extra_vacuum）"
msgstr "extra_vacuum"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:103
#: ffc885677173457d9d16834e19ccccbd
msgid "`float`，默认 `0 Å`，仅在扩展晶胞时生效。"
msgstr "`float`, default `0 Å`, used only when cell extension is enabled."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:105
#: f57b043f863146239c372fd1653594f7
msgid "折回最终晶胞（wrap）"
msgstr "Wrap into Final Cell (wrap)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:107
#: 54cf06560fc741f5b629fedf5892e8a2
msgid "`bool`，默认关闭。开启后在复制和形变全部完成后，按最终晶胞的周期方向折回坐标。"
msgstr ""
"`bool`, disabled by default. When enabled, coordinates are wrapped along the periodic"
" directions of the final cell after all replication and deformation steps are "
"complete."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:109
#: 0507cc3bef5b4c39a6474cef20eb833b
msgid "可选表面形变"
msgstr "Optional surface deformation"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:111
#: c61a9edda010460b9dcabc94716e22c6
msgid "形变预设（preset_index）"
msgstr "Deformation Preset (preset_index)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:113
#: b73a2c60cff746c99bdbc3fc0c79b270
msgid "`int`，默认 `1`，对应平整堆叠。其他预设包括二维正弦波纹、高斯凸起、抛物面、条纹波纹 和阶跃；选择预设会写入对应表达式和参数。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `1`, corresponding to a flat stack. Other presets include a two-"
"dimensional sinusoidal ripple, Gaussian bump, paraboloid, stripe ripple, and step. "
"Selecting a preset fills in its expression and parameters."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:116
#: 7af7703fc7ea4234960d49d5b5d70645
msgid "z 位移表达式（dz_expr）"
msgstr "dz_expr"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:118
#: 5615b4cdf68b4dcc86951484d512f4a0
msgid ""
"`str`，默认 `0`，结果单位 Å。可使用笛卡尔 `x/y/z`、`pi/e`、常见三角与指数函数， 以及 "
"`where`、`clip`、`min`、`max`。表达式经过语法白名单检查。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `0`, with the result in Å. The expression may use Cartesian `x/y/z`, "
"`pi/e`, common trigonometric and exponential functions, and `where`, `clip`, `min`, "
"and `max`. Syntax is restricted by an allowlist."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:121
#: 06f70348e89b46a1859a847c0621b600
msgid "表达式参数（expression_params）"
msgstr "expression_params"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:123
#: ffc515d82beb4d7fbdc5a5e81eaf01e1
msgid "`str`，默认空。使用 `name=value`，例如 `A=0.2, Lx=10`。"
msgstr "`str`, empty by default. Use `name=value`, for example `A=0.2, Lx=10`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:125
#: 161777f2ce2a4a22afdaa2bff542dcde
msgid "形变选择（apply_mode）"
msgstr "Deformation Selection (apply_mode)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:127
#: 2b0a1f995068473e8d3c2ea74a1e2691
msgid "`int`，默认 `0`：`0` 为全部原子，`1` 为指定元素，`2` 为笛卡尔 z 范围。该选择只限制 形变，复制时仍复制完整 slab。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `0`: `0` selects all atoms, `1` selected elements, and `2` a Cartesian"
" z range. This selection limits only the deformation; replication always copies the "
"complete slab."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:130
#: c30e6b12b6974dc09322d0ceb5f8054d
msgid "指定元素（elements）"
msgstr "elements"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:132
#: f658bd2ac77b42919764ba7eae0ee2ad
msgid "`str`，仅 `apply_mode=1` 时生效，例如 `S, Se`。"
msgstr "`str`, used only when `apply_mode=1`, for example `S, Se`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:134
#: 440ca5fda99c441da61222ea4fb632cc
msgid "笛卡尔 z 范围（z_range）"
msgstr "Cartesian z Range (z_range)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:136
#: d14510027e0d47029819bcee442151f7
msgid "`tuple[float, float]`，仅 `apply_mode=2` 时生效，单位 Å；上下限写反时自动交换。"
msgstr ""
"`tuple[float, float]`, used only when `apply_mode=2`, in Å. Reversed bounds are "
"swapped automatically."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:138
#: 5c75ddbf9b6b431583551bf149812722
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:140
#: 6ca137fbd98c430694e7f5ce6115d438
msgid ""
"**为什么旧工作流显示“副本平移量”？** 旧 JSON 没有 `distance_mode`，程序会保留原来的 "
"原点平移语义并显示迁移提示，不会静默把旧数值解释成表面间隙。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does an old workflow show `Copy translation`?** Legacy JSON has no "
"`distance_mode`, so the program preserves the original origin-to-origin translation "
"semantics and shows a migration notice. It does not silently reinterpret the old "
"value as a surface gap."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:143
#: 048a66ab84c84be4acda7b3d7cdf9d06
msgid "**为什么只选择 S，输出仍复制了 Mo？** 元素选择只限制表面形变；每个副本始终包含完整 输入 slab。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is Mo still copied when only S is selected?** The element selection limits only"
" the surface deformation; every copy always contains the complete input slab."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/layer-copy-card.md:146
#: beb37b7fcb1a4b448aec71c73d459320
msgid "**为什么所有层的波纹相同？** 表达式只计算一次，再复制同一份形变结构；本卡不生成逐层 相位差或随机波纹。"
msgstr ""
"**Why do all layers have the same ripple?** The expression is evaluated once and the "
"same deformed structure is then copied. This card does not generate layer-dependent "
"phase shifts or random ripples."

#~ msgid "层复制（Layer Copy）"
#~ msgstr "Layer Copy"

#~ msgid "功能说明"
#~ msgstr "What the card does"

#~ msgid "对选定原子的 z 坐标施加表达式调制 `dz = f(x, y, z)`，然后将变形后的层按指定层间距和层数沿 z 方向堆叠复制。可选扩胞 z 向盒子和增加真空。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Apply a displacement expression `dz=f(x,y,z)` to "
#~ "selected atoms, then stack copies of the "
#~ "modified layer along z with a specified "
#~ "spacing and layer count. The z cell and"
#~ " extra vacuum can be extended automatically."

#~ msgid "操作示例"
#~ msgstr "Example workflow"

#~ msgid "场景：模型在多层异质结的层间耦合上预测失败"
#~ msgstr "Scenario: The model fails on interlayer coupling"

#~ msgid "你在单层 MoS2 上训练了一个 NEP 模型，单层性质很好。然后尝试跑双层 MoS2——层间距离预测偏了 0.5 Å，层间滑移能垒完全不对。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "A NEP trained on monolayer MoS2 performs "
#~ "well in plane but misses bilayer spacing "
#~ "by 0.5 Å and predicts the wrong "
#~ "interlayer sliding barrier."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**诊断思路：** 单层 MoS2 里所有原子都是表面原子（双面都有真空），但双层结构中层间区域的 S "
#~ "原子面对的是另一层 S，局域环境完全不同。训练集里只有单层数据，模型没见过\"上下都有近邻原子\"的层间环境。需要从单层出发，复制出多层堆叠结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Diagnosis:** In a monolayer, both surfaces "
#~ "face vacuum. In a multilayer, interfacial S"
#~ " atoms face another layer and have "
#~ "different local environments. Build stacked "
#~ "structures, then relax and label them to "
#~ "add interlayer chemistry."

#~ msgid "**输入：** 一个弛豫好的单层 MoS2 slab"
#~ msgstr "**Input:** A relaxed monolayer MoS2 slab."

