#~ msgid "这张卡做什么"
#~ msgstr "What this card does"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`Layer Copy` 把**完整输入结构**沿笛卡尔 z 方向平移复制，合并成一个多层结构。复制前还可以用"
#~ " `dz=f(x,y,z)` 对选定原子施加一次 z "
#~ "向形变；所有副本使用同一份形变结果，因此波纹同相，不会为每层随机生成不同形状。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Layer Copy` translates and copies the "
#~ "**complete input structure** along Cartesian z "
#~ "and merges the copies into a multilayer "
#~ "structure. Before copying, apply one z-direction "
#~ "deformation `dz=f(x,y,z)` to selected atoms; every"
#~ " copy uses the same deformed result, so "
#~ "the ripples stay in phase instead of "
#~ "being randomized independently for each layer."

#~ msgid "它适合从一个已经定向到 xy 平面的单层 slab 构造同质双层或多层初态。它不是普通三维扩胞，也不能把两种不同材料自动拼成异质结。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Use it to build homogeneous bilayer or "
#~ "multilayer initial structures from a monolayer "
#~ "slab already oriented in the xy plane. "
#~ "It is not a general three-dimensional "
#~ "supercell operation and cannot automatically combine"
#~ " different materials into a heterostructure."

#~ msgid "默认设置是平整双层：不施加形变，复制平移量为 3.35 Å，并沿 z 扩展晶胞。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The default is a flat bilayer: no "
#~ "deformation, a copy translation of 3.35 Å, "
#~ "and cell extension along z."

#~ msgid "先理解“副本平移量”"
#~ msgstr "Understand the copy translation first"

#~ msgid "`副本沿 z 平移量`（`distance`）是相邻副本对应原子之间的**原点到原点平移量**，不是两层外表面之间的真空间隙。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Copy translation along z` (`distance`) is the"
#~ " **origin-to-origin translation** between "
#~ "corresponding atoms in adjacent copies, not "
#~ "the true vacuum gap between the outer "
#~ "surfaces of two layers."

#~ msgid "若输入 slab 的 z 向厚度为 $t$，相邻层的表面间隙近似为："
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "If the input slab has z thickness $t$,"
#~ " the surface gap between adjacent layers is"
#~ " approximately:"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "\n"
#~ "g = d - t\n"
#~ msgstr ""

#~ msgid ""
#~ "其中 $d$ 是 `副本沿 z 平移量`（`distance`）。例如，MoS₂ "
#~ "单层本身有厚度，若希望得到合理的层间表面间隙，不能直接把该间隙填入 `副本沿 z "
#~ "平移量`（`distance`），而应使用完整的层间重复距离。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Here $d$ is `Copy translation along z` "
#~ "(`distance`). A MoS₂ monolayer, for example, "
#~ "has its own thickness; to obtain a "
#~ "sensible surface-to-surface gap, do not "
#~ "enter that gap directly as `distance`. Enter"
#~ " the full repeat distance between layers "
#~ "instead."

