#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`Layer Copy → Atomic Perturb`: add local "
#~ "thermal perturbations on top of the regular"
#~ " stacking."

#~ msgid "为什么填了 3 Å，层间却重叠？"
#~ msgstr "Why do the layers overlap when I enter 3 Å?"

#~ msgid "因为 3 Å 是完整副本的平移量，不是表面间隙。应把输入层厚度计入，使用层间重复距离。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Because 3 Å is the translation of a "
#~ "complete copy, not the surface gap. Include"
#~ " the input-layer thickness and use the "
#~ "interlayer repeat distance."

#~ msgid "为什么只选择了 S，输出仍复制了 Mo？"
#~ msgstr "Why is Mo still copied when I selected only S?"

#~ msgid "元素选择只限制表面形变。每一层始终复制完整结构，否则会破坏原层的化学组成。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Element selection limits only the surface "
#~ "deformation. Every layer always copies the "
#~ "complete structure; otherwise the chemistry of "
#~ "the original layer would be broken."

#~ msgid "为什么每层波纹完全一样？"
#~ msgstr "Why are the ripples identical in every layer?"

#~ msgid "表达式先作用于输入结构，再复制同一份形变结果。当前卡片不生成逐层相位差、交替起伏或随机波纹。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "The expression is applied to the input "
#~ "structure before copying, and the same "
#~ "deformed result is reused. The card does "
#~ "not generate layer-dependent phase shifts, "
#~ "alternating corrugations, or random ripples."

#~ msgid "为什么扩胞后结构没有居中？"
#~ msgstr "Why is the structure not centered after cell extension?"

#~ msgid "扩胞只增加第三条晶格矢量的 z 分量，不平移已有原子。需要居中时，应在输入前或后续流程中显式处理。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Cell extension only increases the z component"
#~ " of the third lattice vector; it does "
#~ "not translate existing atoms. Center the "
#~ "structure explicitly before input or in a "
#~ "later workflow step if needed."

